import{_ as i,o as n,c as t,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 217 | Sense Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Seven Levels of Perception Precision","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 217 | Sense Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Seven Levels of Perception Precision","no":217,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Sense Origin Realm","Supplement","Perception Precision","Seven Levels"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law","21-Symbiosis Network Operating Principles"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0217_模块1-感元境补遗-感知精度七层级.md","filePath":"en/0217_模块1-感元境补遗-感知精度七层级.md"}'),o={name:"en/0217_模块1-感元境补遗-感知精度七层级.md"};function s(a,e,l,c,p,u){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[r('<h1 id="entry-217-sense-origin-realm-deep-supplement-seven-levels-of-perception-precision" tabindex="-1">Entry 217 | Sense Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Seven Levels of Perception Precision <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-217-sense-origin-realm-deep-supplement-seven-levels-of-perception-precision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 217 | Sense Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Seven Levels of Perception Precision&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 15, 21</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-perception-precision-is-the-first-realm-s-true-watershed" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Perception precision is the first realm&#39;s true watershed <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-perception-precision-is-the-first-realm-s-true-watershed" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Perception precision is the first realm&#39;s true watershed&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos)&#39;s Sense Origin Realm superficially is the &quot;perceiving energy&quot; entry stage, but internal perception precision differences actually determine how far a cultivator can go in the future. Many cultivators think &quot;Sense Origin is just about being able to perceive,&quot; not knowing perception precision gaps will be exponentially amplified in every subsequent realm — a coarse perceiver condenses more energy impurities at Condensed Origin, has lower transformation efficiency at Transform Origin, understands laws more shallowly at Law Origin. Perception precision is not a metaphysical &quot;feels good&quot; question, but <strong>the bottom parameter determining the entire cultivation career&#39;s quality</strong>.</p><p>The six top-level axioms take effect on the Sense Origin perception-precision dimension equally: the anti-predation axiom requires perception training not damage the environment; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires perception-precision training methods open to Myriad Races; the collective ascension axiom requires perception data shared back to the network; the causal self-discipline axiom requires perception behavior not overstep to pry into others&#39; privacy; the law-first axiom ensures the seven-level division&#39;s law definitions are stable and self-consistent; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This entry subdivides Sense Origin&#39;s perception precision into seven levels, explaining their features, training methods, and transition conditions one by one.</p><h2 id="i-seven-levels-of-perception-precision-overview" tabindex="-1">I. Seven Levels of Perception Precision Overview <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-seven-levels-of-perception-precision-overview" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Seven Levels of Perception Precision Overview&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Name</th><th>Perception Feature</th><th>Typical Manifestation</th><th>Transition Marker</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>L1</td><td>Hazy sense</td><td>Vaguely perceiving energy &quot;existence&quot;</td><td>Only feeling &quot;something&quot; around, cannot say what</td><td>From numb to feeling</td></tr><tr><td>L2</td><td>Outline sense</td><td>Distinguishing energy&#39;s rough form and direction</td><td>Pointing out &quot;there is a strand of energy over there&quot;</td><td>From vague to locating</td></tr><tr><td>L3</td><td>Classification sense</td><td>Distinguishing different energy types</td><td>Distinguishing spiritual qi, law power, impurity energy</td><td>From locating to classifying</td></tr><tr><td>L4</td><td>Stability sense</td><td>Stably perceiving in any environment</td><td>Maintaining clear perception even in noisy energy fields</td><td>From easily disturbed to stable</td></tr><tr><td>L5</td><td>Precision sense</td><td>Perceiving energy&#39;s fine structure and fluctuation frequency</td><td>Distinguishing different purity grades of the same energy</td><td>From stable to fine</td></tr><tr><td>L6</td><td>Field sense</td><td>Simultaneously perceiving large-range energy field&#39;s overall distribution</td><td>Mapping an area&#39;s energy distribution</td><td>From single point to field</td></tr><tr><td>L7</td><td>Resonance sense</td><td>Perception resonates with energy, reaching &quot;cultivation by perception&quot;</td><td>Perception itself is cultivation, in deep perception energy auto-optimizes</td><td>From perception to resonance</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-l1-l3-establishing-basic-perception" tabindex="-1">II. L1-L3: Establishing Basic Perception <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-l1-l3-establishing-basic-perception" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. L1-L3: Establishing Basic Perception&quot;">​</a></h2><p><strong>L1 hazy sense</strong> is Sense Origin&#39;s starting point. The cultivator first perceives free energy in the cosmos, this feeling is like seeing a glimmer of light in darkness — vague, unstable, fleeting. Training method is guiding consciousness into &quot;perception mode&quot; via basic methods, lasting weeks to months. The anchor network provides a &quot;perception guidance wave&quot; at this level, lowering the entry threshold.</p><p><strong>L2 outline sense</strong> requires the cultivator to upgrade from &quot;knowing energy exists&quot; to &quot;knowing where energy is and what it looks like.&quot; Training focus is direction sense and form sense — close eyes, which direction is energy? Thick or thin? Flowing or still? This level&#39;s transition marker is: being able to stably locate at least three independent energy sources within five meters.</p><p><strong>L3 classification sense</strong> is Sense Origin&#39;s most critical basic gate. The cultivator must learn to distinguish different energy types: pure spiritual qi, law power, impurity energy, others&#39; residual energy, etc. Lack of classification ability directly causes Condensed Origin to condense wrong energy. This level&#39;s training is provided by the anchor network&#39;s &quot;energy sample library&quot;; cultivators repeatedly identify various energy samples in a safe environment until accuracy meets standard.</p><h2 id="iii-l4-l5-deepening-perception-precision" tabindex="-1">III. L4-L5: Deepening Perception Precision <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-l4-l5-deepening-perception-precision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. L4-L5: Deepening Perception Precision&quot;">​</a></h2><p><strong>L4 stability sense</strong> solves &quot;can you maintain perception in complex environments.&quot; In actual cultivation, energy environments are often noisy — multiple energies interweaving, external interference nonstop, own emotional fluctuation. L4 cultivators must maintain the perception channel&#39;s signal-to-noise ratio under these complex conditions. Training methods include: maintaining perception in simulated energy storm environments, keeping perception stable during emotional fluctuation, not fatiguing after long perception.</p><p><strong>L5 precision sense</strong> is Sense Origin&#39;s deep-cultivation core. Cultivators reaching this level can distinguish different purity, frequency, source of the same energy. This is critical for subsequent Condensed Origin&#39;s &quot;choosing what to condense&quot; — cultivators with insufficient precision sense will also condense impurity energy into internal circulation, endless trouble. L5 training methods include: energy spectrum analysis, purity comparison exercises, source tracking training.</p><h2 id="iv-l6-l7-high-order-forms-of-perception" tabindex="-1">IV. L6-L7: High-Order Forms of Perception <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-l6-l7-high-order-forms-of-perception" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. L6-L7: High-Order Forms of Perception&quot;">​</a></h2><p><strong>L6 field sense</strong> requires the cultivator to upgrade from &quot;perceiving one point&quot; to &quot;perceiving one surface.&quot; Their consciousness can simultaneously cover an area, mapping that area&#39;s energy distribution. This ability directly applies to Transform Origin&#39;s environmental utilization and Law Origin&#39;s law observation. L6 training methods are expanding perception range, training parallel perception, learning field modeling.</p><p><strong>L7 resonance sense</strong> is Sense Origin&#39;s apex. Cultivators reaching this level have their perception itself already resonate with the energy field — perception behavior is no longer &quot;seeing with eyes,&quot; but &quot;being in sync with energy.&quot; In this state, deep perception itself is a kind of cultivation: energy in resonance auto-optimizes, auto-purifies, auto-calibrates. L7 cultivators after entering Condensed Origin have condensation efficiency far exceeding ordinary cultivators — because from the perception stage they have already completed energy&#39;s initial screening and calibration.</p><h2 id="v-relationship-of-seven-levels-with-subsequent-realms" tabindex="-1">V. Relationship of Seven Levels with Subsequent Realms <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-relationship-of-seven-levels-with-subsequent-realms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Relationship of Seven Levels with Subsequent Realms&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The seven levels of perception precision are not Sense Origin&#39;s internal play, but directly affect basic parameters of every subsequent realm:</p><ul><li><strong>For Condensed Origin</strong>: cultivators with L5+ precision sense reduce impurity rate by 60%+ when condensing</li><li><strong>For Transform Origin</strong>: L6 field sense directly improves energy transformation&#39;s environmental adaptation</li><li><strong>For Law Origin</strong>: L7 resonance sense is the prerequisite for law perception — no resonance then cannot &quot;hear&quot; laws&#39; voice</li><li><strong>For Dao Origin</strong>: intuition cultivated by long-term high-precision perception is important material for forming personal Dao</li></ul><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: perception precision training screens energy quality at the source, avoiding the enormous waste of subsequent realms &quot;running sick&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: perception training strictly forbids prying into others&#39; energy privacy and karmic lines; perception behavior has clear ethical boundaries</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems&#39; cultivators generally do not value perception precision; &quot;suck from the start&quot; causes crude foundations; Heng Yuan Zhou builds a precision grading system from the first realm</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the seven-level training method has adapted versions for all five Myriad Races genealogies — carbon-based life uses biological perception, energy life uses frequency perception, mechanical life uses spectrum perception, consciousness life uses resonance perception</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: seven-level training methods, sample libraries, and assessment tools are all free and open, the Alaya Network shares synchronously</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Sense Origin&#39;s seven levels of perception precision reveal a truth often overlooked: the first realm&#39;s depth determines the entire cultivation career&#39;s height. In predatory-faction systems, cultivators eager to &quot;become strong&quot; skip perception training and directly devour energy; looks fast, actually foundation completely ruined. In the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, walking the seven levels level by level solidly; looks slow, actually every step is laying groundwork for subsequent million-level advancement. Slown is fast, this is anti-predation&#39;s concrete manifestation in cultivation details.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiosis Network Operating Principles</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const h=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,h as default};
